      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear u on the risks, but i'm just looking for general info. like if someone was looking at high-potency iron, would something like 200mg or 300mg once a day be considered a standard loading dose in some wellness protocols? i'm not asking u to prescribe it to me, just want to understand the scale of what people do for optimization.",
